# T8/T9/T10: true multi-region conduction against the ANALYTICAL two-layer
# series-resistance slab (derived in this file; nothing taken from CFDApp).
# 'uniformity' = worst deviation of the per-area conduction flux over every
# y-normal face (walls, layer interiors and the MATERIAL INTERFACE) from the
# analytical q. 'iface-asym' = |A(P,N)+A(N,P)| on interface faces, from the matrix.
# On a SHEARED mesh the conjugate operator is uncorrected on internal faces by
# design, so the analytical profile is not reproducible there; T9's criteria
# (conservation, interface continuity) are the ones applied to it.

